# IBM Bob Session Exports

This directory will contain exported IBM Bob conversation sessions for hackathon submission.

## What to Include

Before submitting the project, export your IBM Bob sessions and place them here:

- `sessions-export.pdf` - PDF export of all IBM Bob conversations
- `prompt-development.md` - Documentation of prompt engineering process
- `test-results.md` - Sample analyses and results

## Instructions

1. During development, use IBM Bob to test and refine prompts
2. Document all significant conversations and iterations
3. Export sessions as PDF before final submission
4. Include screenshots of successful analyses

This demonstrates how IBM Bob was used as the core AI engine throughout development.